    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1170">

                <pb facs="1707" n="1691" sameAs="frus:frus1949v06/pg1691"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">501.BC
                    Kashmir/3–1149: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                            Embassy in the United Kingdom
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">secret</hi>
                    </seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-03-11T12:00:00-05:00">March 11,
                            1949—noon</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>811. Embtel 765 Mar 2.<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d1170-f1"/>
                    FYI repeal embargo now being prepared Pres’s
                    consideration having been cleared Secys State and Defense. Dept anticipates
                    early favorable action Pres. Due limitations availability arms this country,
                    however, repeal will have little effect our supply to GOI and GOP.</p>
                <p>Dept currently being pressed for arms procurement assistance and supply from Govt
                    sources by GOI, GOP and Afghanistan. In order better appraise their needs Dept
                    would appreciate such info as Emb can obtain informally re UK arms deliveries
                    these countries.</p>
                <p>Dept also interested knowing whether CRO decision
                    to no longer inform each Dominion of UK arms deliveries to other signifies any
                    basic change UK policy re supply arms to GOI and
                        GOP.</p>
                <p>Rptd to New Delhi, Karachi, Kabul as agam.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
